    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A send control code effect facet is a grouping of characteristics unique to the effects of actions upon observable objects where a control code, or other control-oriented communication signal, is sent to the observable object. An example of this would be an action sending a control code changing the running state of a process.</rdfs:comment>
