    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Defines an open-vocabulary of possible drive types, as enumerated by the WINAPI GetDriveType function: http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/windows/desktop/aa364939(v=vs.85).aspx.</rdfs:comment>
