    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A file facet is a grouping of characteristics unique to the storage of a file (computer resource for recording data discretely in a computer storage device) on a file system (process that manages how and where data on a storage device is stored, accessed and managed). [based on https://en.wikipedia.org/Computer_file and https://www.techopedia.com/definition/5510/file-system]</rdfs:comment>
