    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A trigger type is a grouping of characterizes unique to a set of criteria that, when met, starts the execution of a task within a Windows operating system. [based on https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/taskschd/task-triggers]</rdfs:comment>
