    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A wiki is an online hypertext publication collaboratively edited and managed by its own audience directly using a web browser. A typical wiki contains multiple pages/articles for the subjects or scope of the project and could be either open to the public or limited to use within an organization for maintaining its internal knowledge base. [based on https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wiki]</rdfs:comment>
