    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A pipe is a mechanism for one-way inter-process communication using message passing where data written by one process is buffered by the operating system until it is read by the next process, and this uni-directional channel disappears when the processes are completed. [based on https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pipeline_(Unix) ; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anonymous_pipe]</rdfs:comment>
