    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Hostname</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hostname is a label that is assigned to a device connected to a computer network and that is used to identify the device in various forms of electronic communication, such as the World Wide Web. A hostname may be a domain name, if it is properly organized into the domain name system. A domain name may be a hostname if it has been assigned to an Internet host and associated with the host's IP address. [based on https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hostname]</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
