    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-syntax/#Imports"/>
    <sh:message xml:lang="en">'The import closure of [ontology] O SHOULD NOT contain ontologies O_1 and O_2 such that ... O_1 contains an ontology annotation owl:incompatibleWith with the value equal to either the ontology IRI or the version IRI of O_2.'  The focusNode directly imported an incompatibility it declared (the value node).</sh:message>
