    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">WindowsHandle</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Windows handle is an abstract reference to a resource within the Windows operating system, such as a window, memory, an open file or a pipe. It is the mechanism by which applications interact with such resources in the Windows operating system.</rdfs:comment>
